# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-

TITLE: conditional call, no body, if=
IN:
 <!yatt:args x>
 <yatt:hello if="&yatt:x; >= 2"/>world!
 
 <!yatt:widget hello>
 <h2>Hello</h2>
PARAM[
- 1
]
OUT:
 world!

PARAM[
- 2
]
OUT:
 <h2>Hello</h2>
 world!

TITLE: conditional call, with body, if=
IN:
 <!yatt:args x>
 <yatt:hello if="&yatt:x; >= 2">world!</yatt:hello>
 
 <!yatt:widget hello>
 <h2>Hello</h2>
 &yatt:body();
PARAM[
- 1
]
OUT:
 

PARAM[
- 2
]
OUT:
 <h2>Hello</h2>
 world!
 


TITLE: conditional call, unless=
IN:
 <!yatt:args x>
 <yatt:hello unless="&yatt:x; >= 2"/>world!
 
 <!yatt:widget hello>
 <h2>Hello</h2>
PARAM[
- 1
]
OUT:
 <h2>Hello</h2>
 world!

PARAM[
- 2
]
OUT:
 world!

TITLE: conditional call, with other args
IN:
 <!yatt:args x>
 <yatt:hello if="&yatt:x; >= 2" who="&yatt:x;"/>world!
 
 <!yatt:widget hello who>
 <h2>Hello &yatt:who;</h2>
PARAM[
- 1
]
OUT:
 world!

PARAM[
- 2
]
OUT:
 <h2>Hello 2</h2>
 world!

TITLE: conditional call of code argument
IN:
 <!yatt:args x>
 <yatt:hello x>
 <:yatt:world/>
 world!</yatt:hello>
 
 <!yatt:widget hello x world=[code]>
 <h2>Hello</h2>
 <yatt:world if="&yatt:x; >= 2"/>
PARAM[
- 1
]
OUT:
 <h2>Hello</h2>
 
 


PARAM[
- 2
]
OUT:
 <h2>Hello</h2>
 world!
 

TITLE: error - both if and unless
IN:
 <!yatt:args x>
 <yatt:hello if="&yatt:x; >= 2" unless="&yatt:x; >= 4"/>
 
 <!yatt:widget hello>
 <h2>Hello</h2>
ERROR: Too many conditions

TITLE: error - valueless if
IN:
 <!yatt:args x>
 <yatt:hello if/>
 
 <!yatt:widget hello>
 <h2>Hello</h2>
ERROR: Condition 'if' requires a value
